  "starter": "",
  "solution": "SELECT MIN(freight_charge) AS min_charge, MAX(freight_charge) AS max_charge FROM shipments;",
  "hint": "MIN and MAX in the same SELECT.",
  "required": false
}
```

```exercise
{
  "id": "sql-06-d3",
