hearings = pd.read_csv(legal + "hearings.csv")

check = matters.merge(hearings[["matter_id"]].drop_duplicates(), on="matter_id", how="left", indicator=True)
no_hearings = check[check["_merge"] == "left_only"]
len(no_hearings)
```

