values ('cloud-devops-engineer', 'cloud-devops-engineer', 'Become a Cloud & DevOps Engineer', 'The route to cloud and DevOps roles. Start by understanding what a cloud estate costs, how reliable it is and who can access it, using a real company''s account data, then learn to build and ship infrastructure as code, automate testing and deployment, and keep systems running. Employers hire cloud engineers who can explain a bill and prevent an outage, not just launch servers.', 'CloudTech Cloud & DevOps Engineer', 'CLOUDDEVOPS', array['Cloud services, regions and shared responsibility', 'Cost analysis, rightsizing and pricing models', 'Autoscaling and availability design', 'Access management and security reviews', 'Infrastructure as code and CI/CD', 'Monitoring, alerts and incident response']::text[], 5, true, 'Cloud & DevOps Engineering', true)
